  data: {
    LLM: "Get rid of your high cards (A, K, Q) as early as possible in suits where you have many cards.\n\nIf you are forced to lead a trick, lead a suit where you have only one or two cards (a 'short' suit) to increase your chance of being unable to follow suit later (which lets you dump other high cards).\n\nTrap Tactics: If you know an opponent has no cards left in a particular suit, lead that suit to force them to take a penalty if they are the one supposed to follow suit.",
